<title>PHILIPPINES: PBCom boosts capital, declares 135 pct sto.</title>
<headline>PBCom boosts capital, declares 135 pct sto.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Bank of Communications said on Friday its board had approved an increase of authorised capital to 6.5 billion pesos from 2.0 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The bank also told the Philippine Stock Exchange that it had declared a 135 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Details of the dividend have yet to be finalised pending the approval of the Central Bank and the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8938, fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
